{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上第一段的大号白字和珊瑚红强调词「不再藏着喜欢」「我不再为它道歉」首先吸引视线；随后容易被第二段的金色强调词「连害臊都顾不上了」「没什么不好」吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他意识到自己在乎、喜欢对方，决定不再隐藏这份感情。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"高兴、释然，逐渐不再为自己的喜欢感到羞愧。\",\n  \"missed\": \"对方以后是否还愿意让他陪伴、两人未必能一直亲近，以及欢喜背后隐约的心痛。中间的小字对情绪变化的进一步描写也不容易第一眼获取。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"前两块大字号文字都很显眼，红色和金色强调分别争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心处境主要在第一块，核心情绪主要在第二块，需要视线移动并拼接才能完整理解两者关系。\",\n    \"每块主文字都是较长的句子，内部包含多层意思。\",\n    \"底部第三块同样使用大字号，带来新的情绪信息，进一步分散注意力。\",\n    \"中间小字连续排列，需要逐条阅读才能理解情绪变化的细节。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b8714765-c1aa-46d7-accc-c412bf8f52e2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011959380093Z", "elapsed_seconds": 30.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:20:29.924177+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "814c4394b6829557579a373e2da489727ab81924d7187174c6b1f7c7382c49d8", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\